@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@example.com
@productId = 1

### Upload or replace a product image locally
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/image
X-User-Email: {{adminEmail}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=product-image

--product-image
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="keyboard.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./keyboard.jpg
--product-image--

### Download the product image
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}/image